    dct:description "Pre-registered at 2026-11-01T05:53Z (Douady-Couder disc model, 200 G values, 500 seeds, basin-volume classifier, bootstrap) and the simulator, classifier and bootstrap were written, but a timing run at G = 0.02 did not finish in five minutes on a loaded machine and the session ended before any sweep ran. No basin volumes, no verdict; result.json stays preregistered with its pre-registered fields unchanged. Re-runnable on an idle machine with python3 analysis.py." ;

